{"id":"n37770-1-7","stage":5,"title":"깡충깡충 · 一蹦一跳","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37770-1-7-1","ko":"승규가 드디어 시험에 합격했대요.","zh":"听说承奎终于通过考试了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에","audio":"/audio/6e08c695baae36fe0f89.mp3"}},{"text":"합격했대요.","meaning":"合格，及格，通过","explanation":"합격하다：合格，及格，通过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"합격하다","audio":"/audio/6611b17115450c864474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85306","senseId":"1","lemma":"합격하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합격했대요","audio":"/audio/2e2fb0db96e1856cc650.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"6611b17115450c86","term":"합격하다","zh":"合格，及格，通过","audio":"/audio/6611b17115450c864474.mp3","entryId":"85306","definition":"通过考试、检查、审查等。","pronunciation":["합껴카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/047bab14c73c1b32b784.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37770-1-7-2","ko":"그래서 그렇게 깡충깡충 뛰며 기뻐한 거였군요.","zh":"原来他就是这么高兴得又蹦又跳的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"깡충깡충","meaning":"一蹦一跳，蹦蹦跳跳","explanation":"깡충깡충：一蹦一跳，蹦蹦跳跳","readings":[{"term":"깡충깡충","audio":"/audio/3019fd3d8caa13bfe24b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37770","senseId":"1","lemma":"깡충깡충","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깡충깡충","audio":"/audio/3019fd3d8caa13bfe24b.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰며","meaning":"跳，蹦","explanation":"뛰다：跳，蹦；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65532","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰며","audio":"/audio/614d847c5be08c9b2c32.mp3"}},{"text":"기뻐한","meaning":"高兴，欢喜","explanation":"기뻐하다：高兴，欢喜；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"기뻐하다","audio":"/audio/951b3e791dc729ca8f58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61533","senseId":"1","lemma":"기뻐하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기뻐한","audio":"/audio/8b80ad5f580f4f5e6187.mp3"}},{"text":"거였군요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","sens